		<div class="hero-text">
			<h1>Your research assistant, working from your own Zotero library.</h1>
			<p class="lead">Sub-Sub reads the papers you keep in Zotero, finds the ones you are missing in PubMed, Europe PMC and OpenAlex, and writes notes that say what it read. It also keeps the library in order: it imports, tags and repairs references, and shows you each change before it happens. It runs on your computer and opens in your browser, in English or Portuguese.</p>
			<p class="newcomer">New to Zotero or to AI tools? <a href="/students/">Start here</a> · <a href="/estudantes/" lang="pt-PT">Para estudantes, em português</a></p>

