			<p class="eyebrow">Browser or terminal</p>
			<h2>The same Sub-Sub in both.</h2>
			<p>Open Sub-Sub from its shortcut and it opens in your browser. Type <code>subsub</code> and it opens in the terminal. The modes, the profiles and the approvals are the same.</p>
			<p>The browser view is a small server on your own computer. It listens only on 127.0.0.1 and stops 10 minutes after you close the page.</p>
